  "blog.resampling.bilinear.title": "2. Bilinear Interpolation (Smoother, but Blurry)",
  "blog.resampling.bilinear.when_to_use": "<strong>When to Use:</strong> Rarely for pixel art. More suitable for photographic images.",
  "blog.resampling.choosing.desc": "For Wplace pixel art, <strong>Nearest Neighbor</strong> is almost always the recommended scaling method. It ensures that your pixels remain crisp and distinct, preserving the intended aesthetic. Our Wplace Paint Tool offers Nearest Neighbor as a primary option for this very reason.",
