  "blog.beginner.title": "Getting Started: Your Essential Guide to the Wplace Paint Tool",
  "blog.beginner.troubleshooting.connection": "<strong>Connection issues:</strong> If the tool is unresponsive, check your internet connection and refresh the page.",
  "blog.beginner.troubleshooting.desc": "If you encounter any issues, try the following:",
