  "blog.beginner.troubleshooting.title": "Troubleshooting",
  "blog.beginner.upload.desc": "To begin, simply drag and drop your image into the designated upload area, or click to select a file from your device. We support PNG, JPG, and JPEG formats. For best results, use a high-quality source image.",
