  "testimonials.title": "He aha ngā kaiwhakamahi e kī nei mō te tauhuri pixel toi Wplace",
  "testimonials.user1.name": "Alex_Pixels",
  "testimonials.user1.quote": "Kua hurihia katoa e tēnei taputapu Wplace taku huarahi pixel toi i te papaaho. I mua i taku kitenga i tēnei tauhuri, i pau ai ngā hāora ki te tauhuri whakaahua ā-ringa me ngā raruraru whakataurite tae. Nāianei ka āhei au te tukuake whakaahua katoa ā kite tonu pēhea ai te mata me te kapa ōkawa.",
  "testimonials.user1.role": "Kaitākaro Wplace Tawhito",
  "testimonials.user2.name": "Maya_Ringatoi",
  "testimonials.user2.quote": "Kua whakamātau au i ngā tauhuri pixel toi maha, engari ko tēnei taputapu Wplace he tika rawa, māmā hoki te whakamahi. Ko te āhuatanga whakataurite tae aunoa ka whakaū taku toi ka kitea pēnei nei i taku hiahia i a au e whakanoho nei ki te kānata.",
  "testimonials.user2.role": "Hunga Whakapono Toi Matihiko",
  "testimonials.user3.name": "RocketMaker",
  "testimonials.user3.quote": "Kā whakapono katoa tā mātou rōpū ki tēnei taputapu Wplace hei whakahaere i ngā kaupapa toi hapori nui. Ko te tika me te pono ka mea kia mutu kore mō te whakamahere hoahoa uaua. Kā āwhina ngā taupoki mata ki a mātou ki te whakahaere whakanoho pixel i waenganui i ngā kaiāwhina maha.",
  "testimonials.user3.role": "Kaiarahi Hapori",
  "testimonials.user4.name": "Sarah_Pixel",
  "testimonials.user4.quote": "Hei tētahi waihanga toi taipitopito mō Wplace, kua hurihia e tēnei taputapu wplace taku tahuhu auaha. Ko ngā āhuatanga matatau pērā i te dithering me ngā kōwhiringa whakarahi ka mea kia rerekē rawa mō te tauhuri whakaahua, waitohu, me te toi taketake.",
  "testimonials.user4.role": "Kaihoahoa Auaha",
